{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.StrongCkRecursionKernelConstraints","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.StrongCkRecursionKernelConstraints","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.strong_recursion_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.strong_recursion_step","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L61-L73","doc":"**The depth-2 recurrence theorem.**\n\nThe identical depth-2 recursive operator, seeded by the respective topological\ninvariant, generates both the weak precision ladder c_k and the strong\nmulti-body binding weights w_n.\n\nw_{n+1} = (1/2) w_n + r_{res} w_{n-1}\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.applyStrongRecursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.applyStrongRecursion","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L50-L59","doc":"**The q-Difference Recursion.**\n\nThe geometric constants above (3 and 2.5) serve as the derived exact kernels\nR(q,x) for the multi-nucleon strong force.\nTo generate the exact per-body weights w_n(K) across the full isotopic scale\n(from Deuteron to ⁴He and beyond), this kernel feeds directly into the\nq-difference generating function.\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.strongKernel_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.strongKernel_derived","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L45-L48","doc":"**The derived NA-Stokes values for the Strong Kernel.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.residual","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.gluonic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.gluonic","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StrongForce.StrongKernel","kind":"structure","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/strong-ck-recursion-kernel-constraints.lean#L34-L43","doc":"**The Strong Force NA-Stokes Interaction Kernel.**\n\nThe strong force manifests via two fundamental 2-strand interactions.\nWe evaluate their categorical trace ratios against their topological boundaries:\n- Gluonic Binding (Internal Force): T_{2,9} / T_{2,3} → 3\n- Residual Strong Force (Nucleon-Nucleon Binding): T_{2,5} / T_{2,2} → 5/2 = 2.5\n","signatureChunk":0}]}